  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 6004.01 NFPA Codes and Standards",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6004.01 NFPA Codes and Standards. Copies of NFPA codes and standards incorporated by reference in these rules shall be available for research at the office of the state fire marshal and may be purchased through the National Fire Protection Association, Inc., One Batterymarch Park, Quincy, Massachusetts, 02269 or www.nfpa.org, as further described in Appendix B.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Saf-C 6000) #13094, eff 8-25-20",
